msgstr "Staroffice x-drukker.prolog lap"

#: KfiCmModule.cpp:147
msgid ""
"<h1>Font Installer</h1>"
"<p> This module allows you to install TrueType, Type1, Speedo, and Bitmap "
"fonts. If you have StarOffice installed on your system, this can also be "
"configured.</p>"
"<p>This module has 2 main modes of operation:"
"<ul>"
"<li><i>Basic:</i> The underlying folder structure is hidden, and you will "
"only be able to install/uninstall TrueType and Type1 "
"fonts.</li>"
"<li><i>Advanced:</i> This is for more experienced users, and displays the X "
"fonts folder structure - allowing you to add/delete whole folders to/from "
"the X font path. Using this mode you can also install/uninstall Speedo and "
"Bitmap (pcf, bdf, and snf) fonts.</li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Skrif tipe Installeerder</h1>"
"<p> Hierdie module laat toe jy na installeer Truetype, Tipe1, Speedo, en "
"Biskaart skriftipes. As jy het Staroffice geïnstalleer op jou stelsel, "
"Hierdie kan asook wees gekonfigureer.</p>"
"<p>Hierdie module het 2 hoof modusse van operasie:"
"<ul>"
"<li><i>Basiese:</i>"
" Die onderliggende kabinet struktuur is weg gesteekte, en jy sal slegs wees "
"in staat na installeer/oninstalleer Truetype en Tipe1 "
"skriftipes.</li>"
"<li><i>Gevorderde:</i> Hierdie is vir meer ondervind gebruikers, en vertoon "
"Die X skriftipes kabinet struktuur - toelaat jy na voeg by/uitvee volledige "
"gidse na/van Die X Skrif tipe gids soeklys. Te gebruik Hierdie modus jy kan "
"asook installeer/oninstalleer Speedo en Biskaart (pcf, bdf, en snf) "
"skriftipes.</li></ol>"

#: KfiCmModule.cpp:158
msgid ""
"<p><b>NOTE:</b> As you are not logged in as \"root\", any fonts installed "
"will only be available to you. To install fonts system wide, use the "
"\"Administrator Mode\" button to run this module as \"root\".</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Nota:</b> as jy word nie gelog in as \"root\", enige skriftipes "
"geïnstalleer sal slegs wees beskikbaar na jy. na installeer skriftipes "
"stelsel wye, gebruik die \"Administrateur Modus\" knoppie na hardloop "
"hierdie module as \"root\".</p>"

